{"ID":"20240513082942-cj9g5xi","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513082942-cj9g5xi","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513082942-cj9g5xi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513180118-rxcdj4j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513180118-rxcdj4j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:397,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513180118-rxcdj4j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:485,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:528\u0026#125;","title":"350","type":"doc","updated":"20240515114852"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513180118-rxcdj4j","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 897px;","id":"20240513180118-rxcdj4j","updated":"20240515114852"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/3/6"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"244-1 W, S"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"65歲，胖大"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/3/6"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"前列腺癌及轉移到骨癌"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2001年切除前列腺,之後放射療,現正化療中。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"PSA=46.3；服用許多西藥中。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診：\n1、睡眠："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"睡不好,必須吃安眠藥"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、大便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大便時秘時下利"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→心與小腸搏動/擩動頻率不一致。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3、胃口："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"時好時不好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4、口渴："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 無口渴,人很乾,喝水口乾,口中異味重"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"5、手足溫度："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙足麻,皮脫落；手涼、手掌皮膚乾裂"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6、其他 ﹕"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"骨節痛"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"緩沉"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡白黯(裡寒)，皺縮(像乾橘子，心陽不足)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 心陽不足,裡寒濕重症"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方： \n1."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生附子3錢,干薑3錢,炙甘草5錢,黃連2錢,黃芩3錢,白芍3錢,阿膠3錢(分3包),防己5錢,黃耆5錢,白朮3錢,茯苓5錢,澤瀉5錢,炮附子4錢,桂枝5錢,防風5錢,麻仁3錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生附子3錢,干薑2錢,炙甘草5錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→四逆湯強心陽化裡寒濕"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃連2錢,黃芩3錢,白芍5錢,阿膠3錢(分3包)"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→黃連阿膠湯治心血不足 的失眠"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"防己5錢,黃耆5錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ 通利三焦淋巴系統，除三焦的水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白朮3錢,茯苓5錢,干薑3錢,炙甘草5錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→腎著湯,土克到水,要治土；除下焦寒水，病久必有水積，下焦寒水除去後，肺中津液可下降。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"澤瀉5錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→土克到水,治脾先實腎,這裡要清潔腎臟桂枝5錢,炮附子4錢,白朮3錢→去骨節的風寒濕"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10 付  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"→"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚飯前服"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2. "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"HT-82(攝護腺癌)  午餐前、睡前各40顆"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 前列腺癌會手掌干裂,雙足冷。 因為下焦有實,心火下到下焦而反逆到上肢的手掌，手掌皮膚變很干燥。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 腿上的皮膚干燥脫落來自化療。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}